  "title": "CFDE Knowledge Center Public Webinar Series Features The Knowledge Center",
  "bodyHtml": "<p>The March CFDE Knowledge Center Public Webinar Series featured Julie Jurgens of the Knowledge Center (KC), who presented \"Obtaining Knowledge through the Common Fund Data Ecosystem (CFDE): open access CFDE program information, analysis results, and more.\" Julie Jurgens presented on scientific updates from the Knowledge Center, including the novel method, PIGEAN. <span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(33, 37, 41);display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">If you couldn't make it, check out the </span><a style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(255, 102, 0) !important;font-family:Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ld0INQnXsQQ\" target=\"_blank\">webinar recording</a><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(33, 37, 41);display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"> on YouTube.</span></p><p><img src=\"https://hugea